 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hmalpmkK8esQ7kNvwE6lj54&_nc_oc=AdoTyYhazw2_4XAfV--6nvVHhBhNLdPFVq4S9gKLYCBX1lJHZflu7T5BjaZYFVmM8z0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRi-YGsM7bj6lQXRZQ8E4DB19fvg-c7PpQhy-_I9Fe_pA&oe=6AF092C1"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6ATgbQFWl5MQ7kNvwHG-COC&_nc_oc=AdqTOJ86qghAUVCCqlgiDWiQfWnX85AYglYkEC0qVFBu0fwRvMdw5-jDofyhtuHVb9k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSl5j-kI5dRgJ0UuNxeDo4nZE2EOduUMCdczXLd7x-3-g&oe=6AF0A026"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cOvhnTJXUdQQ7kNvwFThTHk&_nc_oc=Adpe9I-R0PBFWOpMTwDXEhL_KEt-HKLvLSojmToBAhGKnNa0E6LK-FG2WXZ13pgzNhU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR32qHVptDZfyURw70bhEuXlLRu6Q0pHlkBJLT4kl1epQ&oe=6AF0AA1C"}, {"fil